WEBVTT

00:15.010 --> 00:16.140
Emerge!

00:16.140 --> 00:17.050
Burn!

00:17.050 --> 00:17.910
Break!

00:22.980 --> 00:25.490
Unfortunately, the barrier around the Artifacts

00:25.490 --> 00:28.460
won't even crack under that kind of assault.

00:36.000 --> 00:36.990
Crow!

00:37.800 --> 00:39.870
Let me eat your soul!

00:39.870 --> 00:41.670
That's enough, Zwei.

00:55.280 --> 00:55.980
Mahiro?

00:56.480 --> 00:57.820
Are you okay?

00:57.820 --> 00:58.680
Yeah...

00:59.990 --> 01:01.650
Where are we?

01:01.890 --> 01:03.860
That's mine.

01:03.860 --> 01:05.380
Give it up.

01:06.060 --> 01:09.160
Monado doesn't want them dead.

01:11.370 --> 01:13.340
You took too long.

01:15.200 --> 01:17.540
The Artifact was on the verge of being released,

01:17.540 --> 01:20.440
and now it appears to have been suppressed once again.

01:20.440 --> 01:23.880
But I'm sure it's just dozing off.

01:25.410 --> 01:28.850
Now that I've captured the noisy mice,

01:28.850 --> 01:34.760
the time has come for Logos to claim the Artifact,

01:34.760 --> 01:35.920
Monado.

01:55.040 --> 01:57.050
When did I first notice

01:57.050 --> 01:59.050
That your fingers were

01:59.050 --> 02:02.710
So beautiful

02:02.980 --> 02:06.720
And when did I notice this feeling?

02:07.060 --> 02:09.990
So fast that I'll be run over

02:09.990 --> 02:12.630
I cannot keep up

02:12.630 --> 02:15.960
My fearful heart

02:15.960 --> 02:18.730
Puts on the brakes

02:19.130 --> 02:21.500
Our eyes meet

02:22.400 --> 02:23.510
We talk about something

02:23.510 --> 02:26.740
When you look at me

02:27.010 --> 02:31.450
I cannot move

02:33.080 --> 02:40.750
My beating heart is about to break

02:41.020 --> 02:44.990
The arms that catch me pull me

02:44.990 --> 02:49.030
I can't suppress it, I can't express it

02:49.030 --> 02:53.730
That I like you

02:54.040 --> 02:57.010
So much it hurts

02:57.010 --> 03:04.740
The beginning of a love that won't let me breathe

03:08.320 --> 03:11.680
Scarlet

03:08.320 --> 03:11.680
Fragments

03:13.560 --> 03:16.120
<i>I have seen your resolve.</i>

03:16.720 --> 03:20.330
<i>Tonight we will perform a ceremony.</i>

03:20.330 --> 03:24.820
<i>Tamaki, may you be happy in your next life.</i>

03:29.140 --> 03:30.370
O-chan.

03:37.410 --> 03:39.110
What a beautiful sunset.

03:41.480 --> 03:43.040
It's really beautiful.

03:43.850 --> 03:47.520
This is the last sunset that I'll see.

03:48.020 --> 03:49.490
Tamaki?

03:49.490 --> 03:50.790
Excuse me.

04:08.040 --> 04:13.040
Down this path is someone who is waiting for you.

04:15.580 --> 04:18.380
Mitsuru, is that...

04:22.720 --> 04:23.750
Is that all right?

04:24.130 --> 04:27.560
If you let me outside, won't Grandma be mad at you?

04:27.830 --> 04:30.270
The ceremony will start when the sun has gone down.

04:30.270 --> 04:32.260
Please return by that time.

04:32.630 --> 04:34.830
I'll be waiting here.

04:37.610 --> 04:39.940
I understand. Thank you, Mitsuru.

04:44.210 --> 04:47.110
<i>Takuma is just up ahead.</i>

05:19.980 --> 05:26.750
Koi ni ochita no wa honno isshun de
Falling in love happens in a moment

05:27.620 --> 05:39.490
Kimi wo shiru hodo motto suki ni natteita
The more I know about you, the more I like you

05:28.390 --> 05:30.630
You don't have to rush.

05:31.090 --> 05:32.930
I won't disappear.

05:50.510 --> 06:04.260
Deatta hi kara ikutsumo nani ka ga
From the day we met, there was something

05:58.550 --> 06:02.320
What a beautiful sunset.

06:02.320 --> 06:04.260
It's deep into fall.

06:05.660 --> 06:19.500
Kawatte yuku you na fushigi na kimochi de
That seems to be a changing in a mysterious way

06:07.630 --> 06:13.970
You know, Tamaki, I had a lot
I wanted to say to you.

06:13.970 --> 06:17.670
But as soon as I saw your face,

06:17.670 --> 06:19.500
none of it mattered anymore.

06:21.240 --> 06:28.150
Sono riyuu ga nani ka mitomeru made sukoshi
I did not know the reason of it but

06:28.550 --> 06:40.090
Futari toki wo kasanete ima nara hakkiri wakaru yo
After spending time with you, I now know

06:32.390 --> 06:36.360
This area is the most beautiful this time of year.

06:38.060 --> 06:42.530
When the wind blows, the leaves fall like rain.

06:40.090 --> 06:47.870
Te wo nigitta nara nigiri kaeshitekureru
If I hold your hand, you will hold mine back

06:46.500 --> 06:49.700
Do you think it will be beautiful again next year?

06:47.870 --> 06:50.540
Furereba sotto
If I touch you

06:50.710 --> 06:57.740
Dakishimete kureru
You'll embrace me gently

06:50.710 --> 06:52.110
I'm sure it'll be beautiful.

06:54.710 --> 06:56.840
I'd like to see it with you again.

06:57.950 --> 06:58.740
Yeah.

06:58.910 --> 07:08.190
Sore dake de ii sore dake de ii
I'm fine with that, I'm fine with that

06:59.550 --> 07:02.120
I'd like to see it with you again next year.

07:04.920 --> 07:08.190
<i>How wonderful it would have been if I could.</i>

07:09.090 --> 07:11.290
<i>Next year and the year after.</i>

07:11.290 --> 07:13.260
<i>And the year after that.</i>

07:14.100 --> 07:17.900
<i>If I could stay by your side forever and ever.</i>

07:25.110 --> 07:27.210
Why are you crying?

07:25.640 --> 07:30.740
Mata sukoshi no aida
We won't be seeing each other again

07:27.210 --> 07:30.740
Sorry. Takuma, I'm sorry.

07:33.310 --> 07:38.340
Kimi ni aenakute
For some time

07:33.310 --> 07:37.720
<i>If I was just a little better.</i>

07:38.590 --> 07:43.660
<i>If I had awoken as the Tamayori princess earlier.</i>

07:41.060 --> 07:53.070
Mata sugu aeru yo ne demo hanaretakunai yo
I know we'll meet soon but I don't want you to leave

07:45.590 --> 07:49.130
<i>If I had been a stronger person...</i>

08:12.490 --> 08:14.150
<i>It's the same as that time.</i>

08:15.190 --> 08:22.630
Me no mae de warau kimi ga hontou demo uso demo
Whether your smiling face in front of me is real or a lie,

08:15.490 --> 08:18.160
<i>Surrounded by crimson fragments,</i>

08:18.160 --> 08:21.130
<i>the Underworld god and the Tamayori princess...</i>

08:21.130 --> 08:25.300
<i>Both of them wishing to be together longer,</i>

08:22.860 --> 08:32.970
Watashi ni wa subete sore ga shinjitsu de
It is everything to me and that is the truth

08:25.300 --> 08:27.700
<i>but it could never be.</i>

08:34.340 --> 08:44.510
Deau mae nara wakaranakatta
I did not know before I met you

08:35.040 --> 08:36.540
<i>What a broad back.</i>

08:37.780 --> 08:41.680
<i>Takuma, who has protected me</i> <i>again and again...</i>

08:42.950 --> 08:44.510
<i>Thank you, Takuma.</i>

08:45.950 --> 08:53.360
Hitori uzukumatte kimi no kotoba ya shigusa
I squat alone, your words, your gestures

08:46.050 --> 08:49.120
<i>I'm not scared of dying anymore.</i>

08:51.160 --> 08:54.500
Because I wanted to protect you,

08:53.360 --> 09:00.030
Omoidashitemiru sonna jikan sae mo
Even the times I am simply remembering those

08:54.500 --> 08:56.060
I was able to do my best.

08:57.600 --> 08:59.970
I wouldn't mind if the world ended right now.

09:00.030 --> 09:05.640
Nani mo kamo ga itoshii
Anything and everything is just dear and precious

09:02.300 --> 09:03.740
I love you.

09:06.570 --> 09:14.320
Koi ni ochita no wa hon no isshun de
Falling in love happens in a moment

09:06.570 --> 09:12.180
<i>Takuma, I'll die and then someday, when you die,</i>

09:13.150 --> 09:16.150
<i>let's meet in the next life.</i>

09:15.380 --> 09:32.060
Kimi wo shiru hodo motto suki ni natte ita
The more I know about you, the more I like you

09:17.590 --> 09:21.760
<i>In the distant past, even though we were separated,</i>

09:21.760 --> 09:23.420
<i>we were able to meet each other again.</i>

09:25.260 --> 09:26.660
<i>I'm sure we'll meet again.</i>

09:29.230 --> 09:32.060
<i>I'm sure we will...</i>

09:35.270 --> 09:42.570
Te wo nigitta nara nigiri kaeshitekureru
If I hold your hand, you will hold mine back

09:39.370 --> 09:42.040
Tamayori princess, this way.

09:43.210 --> 09:52.950
Furereba sotto, dakishimete kureru
If I touch you, you'll embrace me gently

09:46.880 --> 09:47.750
Um...

09:54.190 --> 10:03.560
Sore dake de ii, sore dake de ii
I'm fine with that, I'm fine with that

09:57.260 --> 09:58.090
<i>Yes...</i>

09:58.460 --> 10:02.360
<i>Long ago, I saw this before.</i>

10:04.400 --> 10:08.700
<i>I just stand in the center, and do what I must do.</i>

10:05.600 --> 10:16.680
Sore dake de ii
I am fine with that

10:10.500 --> 10:12.770
<i>Seal away the released Onikirimaru,</i>

10:12.770 --> 10:15.280
<i>with the soul of the Tamayori princess.</i>

10:22.320 --> 10:25.220
Do you have anything to say before you leave this world?

10:28.490 --> 10:30.050
Nothing.

10:34.730 --> 10:35.750
Damn it.

10:36.300 --> 10:38.500
I can't even smell any movement on the air.

10:38.500 --> 10:40.970
We've been completely sealed in here.

10:41.670 --> 10:46.300
So if this is an Artifact barrier, then only Tamaki can break it.

10:49.810 --> 10:52.080
Still, we've got to do something!

10:52.350 --> 10:53.610
There's no time!

10:55.120 --> 10:56.680
Ohmi,

10:56.680 --> 10:59.780
what are they planning to do with Aria?

11:00.190 --> 11:01.450
I don't know.

11:02.360 --> 11:06.760
But she should be aware by now that they are her enemies.

11:10.360 --> 11:12.430
The time has come.

11:12.430 --> 11:16.300
Let us go retrieve the
Artifact, Monado Aria.

11:16.940 --> 11:19.470
Weren't we going to wait for Eins?

11:19.470 --> 11:21.340
Did he go to steal it?

11:22.880 --> 11:26.310
Seeing as he has not returned, he must have failed.

11:47.400 --> 11:50.100
Takuma! Why do I hear Takuma's voice?

11:50.100 --> 11:51.330
Tamaki!

11:51.910 --> 11:53.880
No! You mustn't!

11:54.410 --> 11:56.540
Tamaki, this is too-

11:56.540 --> 11:57.980
Mitsuru?

12:02.920 --> 12:05.350
My body won't listen to me.

12:05.350 --> 12:07.550
Mitsuru, hurry and get out!

12:07.860 --> 12:09.320
Onizaki...

12:09.320 --> 12:11.850
Onizaki is in that pentagram over there!

12:12.590 --> 12:13.630
Takuma is?

12:13.630 --> 12:15.650
Lady Baba is lying.

12:16.000 --> 12:18.800
If we seal the Onikirimaru like this,

12:18.800 --> 12:21.670
both you and Onizaki will die!

12:23.000 --> 12:26.870
Onizaki is already deeply tied with the Onikirimaru.

12:26.870 --> 12:28.710
But why?

12:28.910 --> 12:33.050
She said, if I seal the sword with my life, then Takuma can live...

12:33.050 --> 12:34.240
That's wrong!

12:37.450 --> 12:38.380
Mitsuru!

12:48.130 --> 12:49.030
Takuma?

12:49.960 --> 12:50.760
Tamaki!

12:51.370 --> 12:53.390
Tamaki, what's going on?

12:53.930 --> 12:57.000
If I give up my life, you'll live! That's what-

12:59.970 --> 13:01.910
You deceived us, Grandma!

13:02.640 --> 13:06.100
We must seal the Onikirimaru,

13:07.010 --> 13:07.910
Tamaki.

13:08.480 --> 13:10.080
But deceiving us...

13:11.590 --> 13:12.110
What?

13:20.290 --> 13:22.090
Tamaki!

13:24.770 --> 13:30.860
It looks like they're sealing the
Artifact with the Sybil's soul.

13:32.170 --> 13:35.870
But I wonder if it will work without the Artifacts.

13:36.640 --> 13:38.200
How pitiful.

13:39.180 --> 13:40.980
Farewell, Sybil.

13:46.490 --> 13:47.790
Aria?

14:09.580 --> 14:10.510
Aria...

14:11.450 --> 14:14.210
All of you, save Sybil.

14:14.680 --> 14:16.780
Why are you saving us?

14:17.690 --> 14:21.020
Killing that thing is not the Logos' objective.

14:21.990 --> 14:24.020
I'll take care of things here.

14:25.190 --> 14:27.990
Understood. Then we'll go.

14:32.170 --> 14:33.190
Let us hurry.

14:40.210 --> 14:43.870
I believe it's too late to go after them now.

14:44.710 --> 14:46.870
He who calls himself Drei,

14:47.480 --> 14:49.780
why don't you reveal your true identity?

14:50.250 --> 14:53.480
Oh, do you know my name?

14:54.390 --> 14:57.460
Someone with that much strength and knowledge

14:57.460 --> 14:59.860
could not be a mere magician.

15:00.960 --> 15:03.560
You're just overestimating me.

15:03.930 --> 15:08.160
You killed the man who should have searched for the Artifact this time,

15:08.870 --> 15:12.270
and became Drei, the third servant.

15:12.270 --> 15:14.670
You wanted the Artifact for yourself, didn't you,

15:15.240 --> 15:17.010
one of the four wise men?

15:17.410 --> 15:19.880
With the moment of becoming a god at hand,

15:19.880 --> 15:22.180
I may have celebrated a bit prematurely.

15:22.980 --> 15:28.010
Indeed, I am one of the four wise men who stand at the top of Logos,

15:28.860 --> 15:30.920
Magus Melchizedek.

15:34.300 --> 15:35.520
Tamaki!

15:38.400 --> 15:39.260
Takuma...

15:40.730 --> 15:44.100
With this the Onikirimaru's power will be eternally sealed.

15:44.870 --> 15:49.810
The time for the blood of the Tamayori to be freed from all constraints has come.

15:50.210 --> 15:52.080
I certainly would like to think so.

15:55.580 --> 15:57.920
Tamaki!

16:11.130 --> 16:11.960
You're...

16:24.410 --> 16:25.240
Tamaki!

16:30.620 --> 16:31.820
Are you all right?

16:31.820 --> 16:33.620
Takuma, I...

16:35.990 --> 16:38.520
So it's destruction you want, Fate?

16:40.790 --> 16:44.200
Then I will overcome you with my power!

16:49.170 --> 16:50.870
What could this be?

16:51.540 --> 16:54.840
If the monster inside the Onikirimaru returns,

16:54.840 --> 16:57.180
it will want the blood of the Tamayori.

16:57.180 --> 16:59.010
Before that happens, I'll...

17:00.450 --> 17:01.470
Takuma.

17:04.520 --> 17:05.920
Trust me.

17:08.820 --> 17:09.790
Okay.

17:12.430 --> 17:14.450
Let go of the sword, Eins!

17:19.600 --> 17:20.620
Takuma!

17:22.900 --> 17:23.960
Why?

17:27.740 --> 17:28.640
Why?

17:28.640 --> 17:30.410
Why do you desire power so much?

17:30.410 --> 17:32.310
That's none of your business.

17:42.390 --> 17:43.450
Takuma!

17:48.530 --> 17:49.620
Stay back.

17:50.030 --> 17:52.400
If you get caught up in that, you'll die in an instant.

17:59.570 --> 18:01.040
Those aren't Eins' eyes.

18:01.210 --> 18:04.200
It's the power of hatred borrowed from the Onikirimaru.

18:05.450 --> 18:08.010
Vanish, Tamayori Princess!

18:11.450 --> 18:13.890
Don't touch my woman!

18:30.870 --> 18:33.200
You can fight me.

18:33.740 --> 18:36.230
I won't hand her over to anyone.

18:36.910 --> 18:38.070
Not anyone!

18:46.850 --> 18:48.220
I'm gradually...

18:48.890 --> 18:50.880
turning into a monster, as well.

18:51.390 --> 18:53.050
Takuma, are you okay?

18:54.230 --> 18:55.890
Yeah, no problem.

18:57.100 --> 19:00.120
This is the true power of the guardians, fully released.

19:01.270 --> 19:04.070
It was awakened by my desire to protect you.

19:07.570 --> 19:09.700
This was from that time...

19:11.450 --> 19:15.780
<i>I'll become a guardian and protect you forever.</i>

19:17.420 --> 19:19.410
<i>Both you and the seal.</i>

19:20.620 --> 19:22.950
When you were the Underworld god,

19:23.490 --> 19:25.760
it was the promise you made to me.

19:29.930 --> 19:31.660
The problem is him.

19:36.700 --> 19:38.190
Tamaki!

19:40.340 --> 19:41.670
You guys!

19:43.910 --> 19:45.310
Are you all right?

19:45.310 --> 19:46.300
Yes!

19:47.010 --> 19:48.310
Mitsuru!

19:53.950 --> 19:58.150
I think it almost had me under its control.

20:03.500 --> 20:06.130
<i>What is this strength of will?</i>

20:07.400 --> 20:10.860
<i>First, I have to find a way to control it.</i>

20:12.210 --> 20:14.300
Where are you going?

20:17.280 --> 20:18.640
Get out of my way!

20:23.020 --> 20:24.040
Grandma!

20:25.350 --> 20:27.050
Stay with me, Grandma!

20:30.990 --> 20:32.360
Damn it!

20:32.360 --> 20:33.550
Where did he go?

20:34.560 --> 20:37.050
As long as I have been the Tamayori princess,

20:38.430 --> 20:42.670
I knew this day would come eventually.

20:43.370 --> 20:45.530
I'm sorry I deceived you.

20:46.370 --> 20:51.680
This was all for the sake of sealing the Onikirimaru.

20:53.380 --> 20:54.710
No...

20:55.880 --> 21:03.190
The truth is, I may have just been jealous of you, Tamaki.

21:04.420 --> 21:08.090
Of you and your bonds with
Takuma and the others.

21:08.430 --> 21:09.690
Grandma...

21:10.360 --> 21:17.740
I always wanted to leave that moonlit room...

21:18.740 --> 21:22.040
But without even the courage to leave,

21:22.040 --> 21:26.710
I was bound to the duty of the seal.

21:27.910 --> 21:36.250
But all of you may be able to step out into a new world.

21:36.620 --> 21:38.420
Grandma...

21:39.260 --> 21:41.230
I, too,

21:41.230 --> 21:45.390
will be released. Finally...

21:52.610 --> 21:54.040
Grandma?

21:56.180 --> 21:57.970
Grandma!

22:01.010 --> 22:10.590
The red sky stains time itself as it envelops us

22:10.590 --> 22:19.330
Did you hug me back so tightly because you're worried?

22:19.900 --> 22:25.010
Tell me everything about the dream you had

22:25.010 --> 22:29.480
That you just started to say, but stopped yourself

22:29.480 --> 22:34.610
We drew each other closer with clumsy hands

22:34.610 --> 22:41.390
Let's embrace the sign guiding us to the same future

22:41.390 --> 22:51.000
Only you, only you, will I swear to love through it all

22:51.000 --> 23:00.870
So keep that smile I want to protect beside me always

23:00.870 --> 23:10.480
I'm sure it was inevitable that
I would feel your tears

23:10.480 --> 23:18.930
So I'll become a breeze that blows on your eyes

23:18.930 --> 23:24.590
I promise you

23:34.940 --> 23:36.170
I have...

23:38.080 --> 23:39.440
something I want to tell you.

23:40.410 --> 23:43.610
I'm only saying it once, okay?

23:46.350 --> 23:48.880
I like you. I love you.

23:51.060 --> 23:53.360
From now until forever.

23:55.100 --> 24:00.970
Next time: The Guardians' Awakening
